      {
        "document_id": "89",
        "explanation": "Senator Dorgan explicitly states that he authored legislation and secured a designation for Bismarck State College, directly taking credit for the outcome. This is a clear example of credit-claiming because he uses first-person language to attribute the achievement to himself."
